	skos:definition	"This segment includes companies that own and operates pipelines that transport raw natural gas from wellheads. Also includes companies that treat, process and finally separate raw natural gas into dry natural gas and natural gas liquids. These companies may realize revenue through toll transportation, processing and storage services or through purchasing, processing and reselling of the underlying products."@en ;
