	rdfs:label	"Inversiones gestionadas de futuros"@es , "Investimenti futures gestiti"@it , "Investimentos de futuros gerenciados"@pt , "Investissements de futures gérés"@fr , "Managed Futures Investments"@en , "Verwaltete Futures-Investitionen"@de , "Управляемые фьючерсные инвестиции"@ru , "管理式期货投资"@zh , "管理期貨投資"@zh-hant , "관리선물 투자"@ko , "ﾏﾈｰｼﾞﾄﾞ･ﾌｭｰﾁｬｰｽﾞ投資"@ja ;
	skos:definition	"This segment includes companies that focus on providing hedge fund investments that employ a managed futures investment strategy. Such a strategy uses a proprietary system or discretionary method that involves going long or short in futures contracts in commodities, such as metals, grains, soft commodities and bond futures, as well as currencies and equity indices."@en ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2014-08-08"^^xsd:date ;
	tempo:validTill	"2020-10-03"^^xsd:date .

