	rdfs:label	"Inversiones de valor relativo"@es , "Investimenti valore relativo"@it , "Investimentos de valor relativo"@pt , "Investissements valeur relative"@fr , "Relative Value Investments"@en , "Relativer Wert-Investitionen"@de , "Инвестиции в относительную стоимость"@ru , "相对价值投资"@zh , "相對價值投資"@zh-hant , "상대가치 투자"@ko , "ﾚﾗﾃｨﾌﾞﾊﾞﾘｭｰ投資"@ja ;
	skos:definition	"This segment includes companies that provide hedge fund investments that employ a relative value investment strategy. Such a strategy exploits pricing inefficiencies between assets that are mispriced. Types of relative value hedge funds are fixed income arbitrage, equity arbitrage, convertible arbitrage and volatility arbitrage."@en ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2014-08-08"^^xsd:date ;
	tempo:validTill	"2020-10-03"^^xsd:date .

<http://data.ga-group.nl/ics/bics/2014/14101112>
