	rdfs:label	"Hedge Fund Investments"@en , "Hedgefonds-Investitionen"@de , "Inversiones de fondos de cobertura"@es , "Investimenti hedge fund"@it , "Investimentos de fundos hedge"@pt , "Investissements fonds de couverture"@fr , "Инвестиции хедж-фондов"@ru , "对冲基金投资"@zh , "對沖基金投資"@zh-hant , "헤지펀드 투자"@ko , "ﾍｯｼﾞﾌｧﾝﾄﾞ投資"@ja ;
	skos:definition	"This industry subgroup includes companies that provide investment management services for individual and institutional investors by investing in a diverse range of assets, such as equities, bonds and commodities. Hedge funds employ a variety of investment strategies to maintain a hedged portfolio designed to protect investors from downturns in the market and maximize returns in upward markets."@en ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2014-08-08"^^xsd:date ;
	tempo:validTill	"2020-10-03"^^xsd:date .

