	skos:definition	"This industry subgroup includes companies that provide traditional investment management services for individual and institutional investors by investing in a mixed asset portfolio. A mixed asset fund invests in a mix of bonds and equities to spread the investment risk."@en ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2014-08-08"^^xsd:date ;
