	skos:definition	"This segment includes real estate investment trusts (REITS) that own and develop flex space. Such space is versatile one- or two-floor structures with ceiling heights up to 16 feet and with some loading door/dock options. Such space can easily be fitted out for office, light manufacturing, R&D and storage all under the same roof and in the same unit."@en ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2014-08-08"^^xsd:date ;
