	skos:definition	"This segment includes real estate investment trusts (REITs) that own and develop office buildings in central business districts (CBDs). Outside of the U.S., if the office is not identified as being in a CBD, the number of stories in the building will be used to determine whether it is CBD (greater than 5+ stories) or suburban (less than 5 stories)."@en ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2014-08-08"^^xsd:date ;
	tempo:validTill	"2020-10-03"^^xsd:date .

