	rdfs:label	"Fármaco genérico"@es , "Farma generici"@it , "Generic Pharma"@en , "Generische Pharma"@de , "Prod farmac genér"@pt , "Prod pharma génériques"@fr , "Типовые фармац. продукты"@ru , "學名藥品"@zh-hant , "非专利药品"@zh , "제네릭 제약업"@ko , "ｼﾞｪﾈﾘｯｸ医薬品"@ja ;
	skos:definition	"This industry includes companies that specialize in manufacturing generic pharmaceuticals and their active ingredients. These companies manufacture off-patent drugs, which require no or little R&D or marketing. Some generic pharmaceutical companies dedicate resources to biosimilar drugs, in which case they will require R&D to commercialize the products and require some marketing spend."@en ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2014-08-08"^^xsd:date ;
	tempo:validTill	"2020-10-03"^^xsd:date .

