	rdfs:label	"Infra As A Service (IAAS)"@de , "Infra as a Service (IaaS)"@en , "Infra come servizio (IAAS)"@it , "Infra comme service (IAAS)"@fr , "Infra como serviço (IAAS)"@pt , "Infra como servicio (IAAS)"@es , "Инфраструктура в виде услуги (IAAS)"@ru , "基础设施即服务 (IAAS)"@zh , "基礎設施即服務（IAAS）"@zh-hant , "서비스형 인프라(IAAS)"@ko , "ｲﾝﾌﾗ･ｱｽﾞ･ｱ･ｻｰﾋﾞｽ(IaaS)"@ja ;
	skos:definition	"This segment includes companies that provide customers access to hardware resources, such as virtual machines, raw block storage, firewalls, IP addresses and virtual local area networks (VLANs), via cloud computing. These companies own, maintain and operate the computer hardware underneath but allow customers to access these resources as a service. This service outsources the maintenance and costs of the computing hardware."@en ;
	tempo:validFrom	"2014-08-08"^^xsd:date ;
	tempo:validTill	"2020-10-03"^^xsd:date .

